      "updated": 1757781249786,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Sorting algorithm is used ot rearrange a given array or list of\nelement in an order\n- Sorting algorithm differ according to output requirements \nfor ex. i) stable sorting ii) unstable sorting",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Sorting algorithm is used ot rearrange a given array or list of\nelement in an order\n- Sorting algorithm differ according to output requirements \nfor ex. i) stable sorting ii) unstable sorting",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "46vkiIx2laXyhxNsollku",
      "type": "text",
