    {
      "id": "oNonOGygdSxh1k7u2DfKx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 558.008552585874,
      "y": 751.7849961873825,
      "width": 758.9989624023438,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "an",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1123235157,
      "version": 972,
      "versionNonce": 1267867253,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757781522104,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- An unstable sort does not guarantee preserving the relative order\nof equal elements.\n- Equal elements may appear in any order after sorting.\nfor ex. same as stable sorting but (4, 'a') and (4, 'c') order is not\nguaranted they appear in any order\n- Common unstable sorting algorithm \n1. Heap sort\n2. Selection Sort\n3. Quick sort",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- An unstable sort does not guarantee preserving the relative order\nof equal elements.\n- Equal elements may appear in any order after sorting.\nfor ex. same as stable sorting but (4, 'a') and (4, 'c') order is not\nguaranted they appear in any order\n- Common unstable sorting algorithm \n1. Heap sort\n2. Selection Sort\n3. Quick sort",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fnNTmrtjFN-7X4RhZ5vzR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 555.7769185392577,
