    {
      "id": "x8rvFZotS603NqADs2Kau",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 556.642754560483,
      "y": 414.317532820659,
      "width": 670.9992065429688,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ap",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1725437333,
      "version": 538,
      "versionNonce": 1620336693,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1757781246697,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- The sorting algorithm preserves the relative order of equal\nelement in the sorted output it is called stable sorting \nfor ex.\ninput = [(4, 'a'), (2, 'b'), (4, 'c'), (1, 'd')]\noutput = [(1, 'd'), (2, 'b'), (4, 'a'), (4, 'c')]\nsort by the number \n- Notice: (4, 'a') and (4, 'c') have same order in input and\noutput, (4, 'a') befor (4, 'c') in input and same output\n- Common stable sorting algorithm:\n1. Merge sort\n2. Insertion sort\n3. Bubble sort",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- The sorting algorithm preserves the relative order of equal\nelement in the sorted output it is called stable sorting \nfor ex.\ninput = [(4, 'a'), (2, 'b'), (4, 'c'), (1, 'd')]\noutput = [(1, 'd'), (2, 'b'), (4, 'a'), (4, 'c')]\nsort by the number \n- Notice: (4, 'a') and (4, 'c') have same order in input and\noutput, (4, 'a') befor (4, 'c') in input and same output\n- Common stable sorting algorithm:\n1. Merge sort\n2. Insertion sort\n3. Bubble sort",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
