      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772777912950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- bubble sort is a simple comparison based sorting algorithm where larger\nelement bubble up to the end of the array through adjacent swaps ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- bubble sort is a simple comparison based sorting algorithm where larger\nelement bubble up to the end of the array through adjacent swaps ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7rSSu7_Od_bkLmvDOd1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 551.8854351266505,
      "y": 1118.850030785922,
      "width": 384.9994812011719,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0C",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 547418389,
      "version": 690,
      "versionNonce": 1316744467,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772777912950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Trick: LARGE - SWAP - MOVE - REPEAT",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Trick: LARGE - SWAP - MOVE - REPEAT",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "g-BUeZbrIoM5NePojpGui",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 550.7576037796352,
      "y": 1151.5296057218081,
      "width": 582.9992065429688,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1075227093,
      "version": 1294,
      "versionNonce": 558027443,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772777912950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Algorithm \n1. Compare adjacent element\n2. Swap if they are in wrong order\n3. Continue throug the array \n4. Repeat until no swaps needed\n5. Largest element bubbles to the end after each pass",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Algorithm \n1. Compare adjacent element\n2. Swap if they are in wrong order\n3. Continue throug the array \n4. Repeat until no swaps needed\n5. Largest element bubbles to the end after each pass",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "V2uI0ojIjwb1sj5tFSLWS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 552.5752995599605,
      "y": 1309.1913045447182,
      "width": 241.99966430664062,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 403794325,
      "version": 790,
      "versionNonce": 1901855827,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772777912950,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Time complexity:-\nBest - O(n)\nWorst - (n^2)\nSpace complexity:- \nInplace sorting - O(1)\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Time complexity:-\nBest - O(n)\nWorst - (n^2)\nSpace complexity:- \nInplace sorting - O(1)\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
