      "text": "for loop \ni=0: [|1|, 8, 0, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → First element (assumed sorted)\ni=1: [|1, 8|, 0, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → Process second element\ni=2: [|1, 8, 0|, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → Process third element\ni=3: [|1, 0, 8, 2|, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → Process fourth element",
