    {
      "id": "LHXk7e4p3P7XfKJw2DQTL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 513.0449959844617,
      "y": 3650.9444444444443,
      "width": 626.9993286132812,
      "height": 900,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 766123217,
      "version": 2048,
      "versionNonce": 41972829,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1772779228667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "While loop\nInitial Array: [1, 8, 0, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n              ↑  Assume first element is sorted\n              i\n\nPass 1: [1, 8, 0, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n           ↑  8 > 1, stays in place\n           i\n\nPass 2: [1, 8, 0, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n              ↑  0 < 8 and 0 < 1, shifts left\n              i\n        [1, 0, 8, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → shift\n        [0, 1, 8, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → final position\n\nPass 3: [0, 1, 8, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n                 ↑  2 < 8, shifts left\n                 i\n        [0, 1, 2, 8, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → final position\n\nPass 4: [0, 1, 2, 8, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n                    ↑  4 < 8, shifts left\n                    i\n        [0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 8, 33, 111]  → final position\n\nPass 5: [0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 8, 33, 111]\n                       ↑  8 = 8, stays in place\n                       i\n\nPass 6: [0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 8, 33, 111]\n                          ↑  33 > 8, stays in place\n                          i\n\nPass 7: [0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 8, 33, 111]\n                              ↑  111 > 33, stays in place\n                              i",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "While loop\nInitial Array: [1, 8, 0, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n              ↑  Assume first element is sorted\n              i\n\nPass 1: [1, 8, 0, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n           ↑  8 > 1, stays in place\n           i\n\nPass 2: [1, 8, 0, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n              ↑  0 < 8 and 0 < 1, shifts left\n              i\n        [1, 0, 8, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → shift\n        [0, 1, 8, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → final position\n\nPass 3: [0, 1, 8, 2, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n                 ↑  2 < 8, shifts left\n                 i\n        [0, 1, 2, 8, 4, 8, 33, 111]  → final position\n\nPass 4: [0, 1, 2, 8, 4, 8, 33, 111]\n                    ↑  4 < 8, shifts left\n                    i\n        [0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 8, 33, 111]  → final position\n\nPass 5: [0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 8, 33, 111]\n                       ↑  8 = 8, stays in place\n                       i\n\nPass 6: [0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 8, 33, 111]\n                          ↑  33 > 8, stays in place\n                          i\n\nPass 7: [0, 1, 2, 4, 8, 8, 33, 111]\n                              ↑  111 > 33, stays in place\n                              i",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "368xzBaJehiDSQ39PwZtw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 485.3522072548684,
      "y": 5234.076490019982,
      "width": 318.9995422363281,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b10",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2136631763,
      "version": 11,
      "versionNonce": 1842647987,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772780815608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Time Complexity  : O(n log n)\nSpace Complexity : O(n)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Time Complexity  : O(n log n)\nSpace Complexity : O(n)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sXCmFkGvdPLhFCgDNcFaD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 493.92363582629685,
      "y": 5309.790775734268,
      "width": 571.9993286132812,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b11",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1255739005,
      "version": 62,
      "versionNonce": 2023138547,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772780853018,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PHASE 1 — SPLITTING (Top-Down)\n\n\n                    [8, 4, 3, 7, 6, 1, 2, 5]\n                              |\n               mid = floor(8/2) = 4\n                    /                   \\\n          [8, 4, 3, 7]             [6, 1, 2, 5]\n               |                         |\n          mid = 2                    mid = 2\n          /        \\                /        \\\n      [8, 4]      [3, 7]        [6, 1]      [2, 5]\n        |            |            |            |\n      mid=1        mid=1        mid=1        mid=1\n      /   \\        /   \\        /   \\        /   \\\n    [8]   [4]    [3]   [7]    [6]   [1]    [2]   [5]\n     ^     ^      ^     ^      ^     ^      ^     ^\n   BASE  BASE   BASE  BASE   BASE  BASE   BASE  BASE\n  CASE  CASE   CASE  CASE   CASE  CASE   CASE  CASE",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PHASE 1 — SPLITTING (Top-Down)\n\n\n                    [8, 4, 3, 7, 6, 1, 2, 5]\n                              |\n               mid = floor(8/2) = 4\n                    /                   \\\n          [8, 4, 3, 7]             [6, 1, 2, 5]\n               |                         |\n          mid = 2                    mid = 2\n          /        \\                /        \\\n      [8, 4]      [3, 7]        [6, 1]      [2, 5]\n        |            |            |            |\n      mid=1        mid=1        mid=1        mid=1\n      /   \\        /   \\        /   \\        /   \\\n    [8]   [4]    [3]   [7]    [6]   [1]    [2]   [5]\n     ^     ^      ^     ^      ^     ^      ^     ^\n   BASE  BASE   BASE  BASE   BASE  BASE   BASE  BASE\n  CASE  CASE   CASE  CASE   CASE  CASE   CASE  CASE",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1Eb6q5JvbHU80-rVdzPvS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 492.4950643977255,
      "y": 5794.013322039243,
      "width": 725.9990844726562,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b12",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 421810493,
      "version": 25,
      "versionNonce": 2114010877,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772780872434,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Each leaf node is a single element — already sorted by definition.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each leaf node is a single element — already sorted by definition.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "sNaLoE1BWk44FsaYZAcmP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 488.2093501120113,
      "y": 5868.299036324956,
      "width": 670.9991455078125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b13",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 900683901,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 629899155,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772780884318,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PHASE 2 — MERGING (Bottom-Up)\nThe merge() function compares elements from two sorted arrays\nand builds a new sorted array one element at a time.\nHow merge() works (step-by-step logic):",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PHASE 2 — MERGING (Bottom-Up)\nThe merge() function compares elements from two sorted arrays\nand builds a new sorted array one element at a time.\nHow merge() works (step-by-step logic):",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "S_yWSJVr-BjMcXI0y3pre",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 489.63792154058274,
      "y": 5988.299036324956,
      "width": 582.9991455078125,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b14",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 595411101,
      "version": 20,
      "versionNonce": 1132014643,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772780892069,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "merge(left, right):\n\n  leftIndex  = 0   (pointer for left array)\n  rightIndex = 0   (pointer for right array)\n  sortedArray = []\n\n  LOOP while both pointers are in bounds:\n    if left[leftIndex] <= right[rightIndex]\n        push left[leftIndex]  --> advance leftIndex\n    else\n        push right[rightIndex] --> advance rightIndex\n\n  AFTER loop: append any remaining elements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "merge(left, right):\n\n  leftIndex  = 0   (pointer for left array)\n  rightIndex = 0   (pointer for right array)\n  sortedArray = []\n\n  LOOP while both pointers are in bounds:\n    if left[leftIndex] <= right[rightIndex]\n        push left[leftIndex]  --> advance leftIndex\n    else\n        push right[rightIndex] --> advance rightIndex\n\n  AFTER loop: append any remaining elements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1fiON6AS6PrXvhlw5xxfU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 498.2093501120113,
      "y": 6384.013322039243,
      "width": 439.9993896484375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b15",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 787774973,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 146303315,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772780912169,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MERGE LEVEL 1 — Pairs of single elements",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MERGE LEVEL 1 — Pairs of single elements",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "qk_xGZWThvEhxPOJUxHFZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 498.2093501120113,
      "y": 6424.013322039243,
      "width": 516.9994506835938,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b16",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 646843005,
      "version": 26,
      "versionNonce": 1512670739,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772780918353,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "merge([8], [4])              merge([3], [7])\n  L=[8]  R=[4]                 L=[3]  R=[7]\n  4 < 8 -> push 4              3 < 7 -> push 3\n  leftover: push 8             leftover: push 7\n  Result: [4, 8]               Result: [3, 7]\n\nmerge([6], [1])              merge([2], [5])\n  L=[6]  R=[1]                 L=[2]  R=[5]\n  1 < 6 -> push 1              2 < 5 -> push 2\n  leftover: push 6             leftover: push 5\n  Result: [1, 6]               Result: [2, 5]",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "merge([8], [4])              merge([3], [7])\n  L=[8]  R=[4]                 L=[3]  R=[7]\n  4 < 8 -> push 4              3 < 7 -> push 3\n  leftover: push 8             leftover: push 7\n  Result: [4, 8]               Result: [3, 7]\n\nmerge([6], [1])              merge([2], [5])\n  L=[6]  R=[1]                 L=[2]  R=[5]\n  1 < 6 -> push 1              2 < 5 -> push 2\n  leftover: push 6             leftover: push 5\n  Result: [1, 6]               Result: [2, 5]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mWNibQDWSp57bKhVnYUnu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 488.2093501120113,
      "y": 6721.1561791821,
      "width": 824.9991455078125,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b17",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 430466195,
      "version": 17,
      "versionNonce": 696302717,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1772780928552,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[8, 4, 3, 7, 6, 1, 2, 5]\n                              |\n          [8, 4, 3, 7]                   [6, 1, 2, 5]\n          /        \\                     /        \\\n      [8, 4]      [3, 7]            [6, 1]      [2, 5]\n        |            |                |            |\n      [4, 8]      [3, 7]          [1, 6]        [2, 5]   <-- Level 1 merged",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
