      "updated": 1772780945920,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "merge([4, 8], [3, 7])\n  L=[4,8]   R=[3,7]\n  sortedArray=[]   L-idx=0   R-idx=0\n\n  Step 1: L[0]=4  vs  R[0]=3  --> 3 < 4  --> push 3   | sortedArray=[3]       R-idx=1\n  Step 2: L[0]=4  vs  R[1]=7  --> 4 < 7  --> push 4   | sortedArray=[3,4]     L-idx=1\n  Step 3: L[1]=8  vs  R[1]=7  --> 7 < 8  --> push 7   | sortedArray=[3,4,7]   R-idx=2\n  R exhausted -> append rest of L: push 8\n  Result: [3, 4, 7, 8]\n\n\nmerge([1, 6], [2, 5])\n  L=[1,6]   R=[2,5]\n  sortedArray=[]   L-idx=0   R-idx=0\n\n  Step 1: L[0]=1  vs  R[0]=2  --> 1 < 2  --> push 1   | sortedArray=[1]       L-idx=1\n  Step 2: L[1]=6  vs  R[0]=2  --> 2 < 6  --> push 2   | sortedArray=[1,2]     R-idx=1\n  Step 3: L[1]=6  vs  R[1]=5  --> 5 < 6  --> push 5   | sortedArray=[1,2,5]   R-idx=2\n  R exhausted -> append rest of L: push 6\n  Result: [1, 2, 5, 6]",
