      "updated": 1772780968154,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "merge([3, 4, 7, 8], [1, 2, 5, 6])\n  L=[3,4,7,8]   R=[1,2,5,6]\n  sortedArray=[]   L-idx=0   R-idx=0\n\n  Step 1: L[0]=3  vs  R[0]=1  --> 1 < 3  --> push 1   | [1]         R-idx=1\n  Step 2: L[0]=3  vs  R[1]=2  --> 2 < 3  --> push 2   | [1,2]       R-idx=2\n  Step 3: L[0]=3  vs  R[2]=5  --> 3 < 5  --> push 3   | [1,2,3]     L-idx=1\n  Step 4: L[1]=4  vs  R[2]=5  --> 4 < 5  --> push 4   | [1,2,3,4]   L-idx=2\n  Step 5: L[2]=7  vs  R[2]=5  --> 5 < 7  --> push 5   | [1,2,3,4,5] R-idx=3\n  Step 6: L[2]=7  vs  R[3]=6  --> 6 < 7  --> push 6   | [1,2,3,4,5,6] R-idx=4\n  R exhausted -> append rest of L: push 7, 8\n  Result: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "merge([3, 4, 7, 8], [1, 2, 5, 6])\n  L=[3,4,7,8]   R=[1,2,5,6]\n  sortedArray=[]   L-idx=0   R-idx=0\n\n  Step 1: L[0]=3  vs  R[0]=1  --> 1 < 3  --> push 1   | [1]         R-idx=1\n  Step 2: L[0]=3  vs  R[1]=2  --> 2 < 3  --> push 2   | [1,2]       R-idx=2\n  Step 3: L[0]=3  vs  R[2]=5  --> 3 < 5  --> push 3   | [1,2,3]     L-idx=1\n  Step 4: L[1]=4  vs  R[2]=5  --> 4 < 5  --> push 4   | [1,2,3,4]   L-idx=2\n  Step 5: L[2]=7  vs  R[2]=5  --> 5 < 7  --> push 5   | [1,2,3,4,5] R-idx=3\n  Step 6: L[2]=7  vs  R[3]=6  --> 6 < 7  --> push 6   | [1,2,3,4,5,6] R-idx=4\n  R exhausted -> append rest of L: push 7, 8\n  Result: [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8]",
      "autoResize": true,
